      "updated": 1742998010983,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ExternalConstant is a new type of operation that:\n\n - encapsulates the Constant(s)\n - encapsulates the Decompression Subgraph\n - a form of the Decomposition Subgraph can be NOT specified\n - content of Constant(s) is OPTIONALLY `linked`",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ExternalConstant is a new type of operation that:\n\n - encapsulates the Constant(s)\n - encapsulates the Decompression Subgraph\n - a form of the Decomposition Subgraph can be NOT specified\n - content of Constant(s) is OPTIONALLY `linked`",
